;This file exercises comment lines, multi-field headers using the
;full symbol set, and CRLF line endings -- none of which the
;NC_009925 genome records do.
;
>synth1|demo_record|symbols: (paren) [bracket] a,b/c:d&e's +end.-ok
ACGTACGTACGTACGTACGT
ACGTACGTACGTACGTACGT
;a comment line splits one run of sequence lines into two sections
ACGTACGT
>synth2|crlf record
MSKQNSKVLLTLAAAAAAAV
TLNAKAQEK
